# expression or None). The note is attached only when a generated question has exactly this question and key and the
# distractor is one of its options, so a reworded bank item loses its note instead of keeping a wrong one. The
# verification smoke recomputes every expression with its own arithmetic and pins every row (reviewed pins, as for the
# bank items themselves); a row with no expression is a pin only, because the slip is about form, not a value.
